* Diodes Inc. BZT52C51 nominal coefficients (not the BZT52C51S model).
* Source: https://www.diodes.com/spice/download/1100/BZT52C51.spice.txt
* Terminals A K. VZ=48.3 is an INTERNAL model voltage, not a 48.3 V rating.
* The reverse diode and its resistance bring the total near 51 V at 5 mA.
* No thermal model or statistical tolerance corners are included.
.SUBCKT DI_BZT52C51 1 2
D1 1 2 DF
DZ 3 1 DR
VZ 2 3 48.3
.MODEL DF D (IS=3.31p RS=1.45 N=1.10 CJO=24.1p VJ=1 M=0.330 TT=50.1n)
.MODEL DR D (IS=6.62e-16 RS=84.5 N=3)
.ENDS DI_BZT52C51

* Legacy alias: old KiCad Sim.Name can remain DI_BZT52C51S.
* This alias now invokes BZT52C51 coefficients, NOT the smaller S device.
.SUBCKT DI_BZT52C51S 1 2
X_ACTUAL 1 2 DI_BZT52C51
.ENDS DI_BZT52C51S
